<title>USA: BP says Ohio plant closure excludes Chemicals.</title>
<headline>BP says Ohio plant closure excludes Chemicals.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum Co Plc said Friday that its plans to shut its 161,000 barrel per day (bpd) Lima, Ohio refinery does not include the nearby chemicals plant.</p>
<p>In a statement, BP said that after &quot;careful analysis of the offers, the decision was made to suspend the sale process.&quot; Three bids, which were less than hoped for and all were unacceptable.</p>
<p>All three bidders for the refinery, whose names have been kept confidential, have been notified of BP's decision.</p>
</text>
